  "Scale patterns and common descriptions of major/minor colour, not a universal emotional rule.": "介绍音阶排列，以及人们对大调、小调常见的感受。这些感受并不适用于所有音乐或所有人。",
  "iZotope · What is timbre?": "iZotope · 什么是音色？",
  "Sound quality distinguished from pitch, loudness and duration.": "介绍音色，以及它与音高、响度、时长的区别。",
  "Hello! Ask me about Aquarium, my other pieces, or how music works. Choose a question below or write your own.": "你好！想聊《水族馆》，还是想了解我写过的其他作品？可以选一个问题，也可以自己问。",
  "Saint-Saëns was a French composer, pianist and organist. Aquarium is one of fourteen movements in The Carnival of the Animals.": "圣桑是法国作曲家、钢琴家和管风琴师。《水族馆》是《动物狂欢节》十四个乐章中的第七乐章。",
  "Explore music.": "走近音乐",
  "Read more about his life and music": "了解他的经历与作品",
  "A childhood at the piano": "从小学习钢琴",
  "Born in Paris in 1835, Saint-Saëns played piano as a child. He later studied at the Paris Conservatoire and won its first prize for organ in 1851. Piano and organ both became important parts of his career.": "圣桑1835年出生于巴黎，童年就开始弹钢琴。后来，他进入巴黎音乐学院学习，1851年获得管风琴一等奖。钢琴和管风琴，都是他擅长的乐器。",
  "Twenty years at the organ": "在教堂演奏的二十年",
  "From 1857 to 1877, he was organist at La Madeleine in Paris. He was a performer as well as a composer: alongside writing music, he played piano and organ for audiences.": "1857至1877年，圣桑在巴黎玛德莱娜教堂担任管风琴师，一做就是二十年。他不只是写乐谱的作曲家，也是登台演奏的钢琴家和管风琴师。",
  "A teacher of other composers": "作曲家，也是老师",
  "He taught piano at the École Niedermeyer from 1861 to 1865. Gabriel Fauré was one of his pupils. In 1871, Saint-Saëns also helped found a society that supported the performance of French music.": "1861至1865年，他在尼德梅耶音乐学校教钢琴，后来的作曲家加布里埃尔·福雷就是他的学生。1871年，他还参与创立法国民族音乐协会，支持法国音乐的演出。",
  "Animals, music and jokes": "写给朋友的《动物狂欢节》",
  "The Carnival of the Animals began as music for a private gathering in 1886. Its fourteen movements include Aquarium and The Swan. Most of it was not published during his lifetime; The Swan was an exception.": "1886年，圣桑为朋友间的聚会创作了《动物狂欢节》。十四个乐章里有《水族馆》，也有《天鹅》。在他生前，大部分乐章并未出版，《天鹅》是例外。",
  "Beyond Aquarium": "不只有《水族馆》",
  "His other works include the opera Samson et Dalila, the orchestral Danse macabre and Symphony No. 3, which includes an organ. He also wrote five piano concertos. These offer quite different starting points for hearing his music.": "圣桑还写过歌剧《参孙与达利拉》、交响诗《骷髅之舞》和加入管风琴的《第三交响曲》，以及五首钢琴协奏曲。想继续听他的音乐，可以从这些不同类型的作品开始。",
  "Music for the cinema": "他也为电影配过乐",
  "In 1908, Saint-Saëns wrote music for The Assassination of the Duke of Guise. So his work reached beyond churches, concert halls and opera into cinema. This film score is a different work from Aquarium.": "1908年，圣桑为电影《吉斯公爵遇刺记》写了配乐。他的创作不只出现在教堂、音乐厅和歌剧院，也走进了电影院。这部电影的配乐与《水族馆》是不同的作品。",
